<title>USA: CFX Corp names Gregg Tewksbury as CFO.</title>
<headline>CFX Corp names Gregg Tewksbury as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>KEENE, N.H. 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CFX Corp said Monday it had appointed Gregg Tewksbury as chief financial officer.  </p>
<p>The company said Tewksbury, formerly corporate controller, will replace Mark Gavin, who has been promoted to executive vice president and chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Gavin replaces Paul Spiess, who will leave the company during the first quarter, it added.</p>
<p>CFX is a multi-bank holding company with assets of $1.6 billion.</p>
</text>
